    "notes": [
      "INFO: Hourly divisor 162 for the 37.5h/week period (2023-11-23 to 2024-06-30) and 160 from 2024-07-01 (37h/week).",
      "INFO: Seniority: first scatto after 48 months, then every 36 months; maximum 8 scatti for the Aree Professionali and 7 for QD3/QD4 (maximum_count_by_level).",
      "SIMPLIFICATION: Apprenticeship (Art. 35, rinnovo 23-11-2023) targets the 3ª area professionale without naming the level; modelled for destination levels 3A2, 3A3 and 3A4 with 18 months one level below, then the destination level. 3A1 is excluded because the level below (Area Unificata 1ª e 2ª area) is not an apprenticeship classification.",
      "SIMPLIFICATION: INPS employer_rate 26.76% flat from kitech.it (Credito e Assicurazioni 2026); the Fondo di solidarietà del credito (bilateral) is presumed included in the aggregate rate. Verify against the annual INPS circular.",
      "SOURCE: Apprenticeship: https://www.ccnlbancari.it/ Art. 35, post-rinnovo 2023-11-23."
    ]
